{
  "id": "ECC.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "ECC",
  "reference": "Eccles. 10",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As dead flies give perfume a bad smell,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "so a little folly outweighs wisdom and honor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The heart of the wise inclines to the right,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but the heart of the fool to the left.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even as fools walk along the road,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they lack sense",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and show everyone how stupid they are.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If a ruler's anger rises against you,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "do not leave your post;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "calmness can lay great offenses to rest.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There is an evil I have seen under the sun,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the sort of error that arises from a ruler:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fools are put in many high positions,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "while the rich occupy the low ones.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have seen slaves on horseback,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "while princes go on foot like slaves.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoever digs a pit may fall into it;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "whoever breaks through a wall may be bitten by a snake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoever quarries stones may be injured by them;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "whoever splits logs may be endangered by them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the ax is dull",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and its edge unsharpened,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ECC 10:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "more strength is needed,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but skill will bring success.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If a snake bites before it is charmed,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the charmer receives no fee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Words from the mouth of the wise are gracious,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but fools are consumed by their own lips.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At the beginning their words are folly;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "at the end they are wicked madness—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and fools multiply words.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "ECC 10:14"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ECC 10:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "No one knows what is coming—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "who can tell someone else what will happen after them?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The toil of fools wearies them;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they do not know the way to town.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woe to the land whose king was a servant",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and whose princes feast in the morning.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Blessed is the land whose king is of noble birth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ECC 10:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and whose princes eat at a proper time—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
